  "body_html": "<h1>Nash Equilibrium</h1>\n<p>A strategy profile $\\sigma$ is a Nash equilibrium if every player is playing a best\nresponse to the strategies of the other players:</p>\n<p>$$\\forall i \\in I, \\quad \\sigma_i \\text{ is a best response to } \\sigma.$$</p>\n<p>Equivalently, no player can improve their payoff by a unilateral deviation.</p>",
